cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "rotating-cylinders: a multi-solver benchmark for Taylor-Couette flow"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark repository for the Navier-Stokes flow between two concentric
  rotating cylinders (Taylor-Couette flow). It provides reference
  implementations and simulation workflows for two CFD solvers (DuMux,
  OpenFOAM) together with problem documentation, postprocessing scripts,
  and RO-Crate-compatible benchmark packaging.
